                            <comment id="16016933" author="roman_s" created="Fri, 19 May 2017 06:00:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Spark has the dependency on the following version&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;&amp;lt;fasterxml.jackson.version&amp;gt;2.6.5&amp;lt;/fasterxml.jackson.version&amp;gt;&lt;/tt&gt;, which conflicts with what we have in the parent pom.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;[INFO] |  +- org.apache.spark:spark-core_2.11:jar:2.1.0:compile
&#8230;
[INFO] |  |  +- (com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind:jar:2.6.5:compile - omitted &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; conflict with 2.8.8)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I propose to change jackson to 2.6.5 in IGNITE project.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=kuaw26&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;kuaw26&quot;&gt;kuaw26&lt;/a&gt; I think you upgraded Jackson before and know this part best. Do you think this solution is ok?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
